msgid ""
"Usage: %s push [OPTIONS]... FINGERPRINT...\n"
"\n"
"Send certificates to the keyservers as they stand, changing nothing.\n"
"Fingerprints only: what is published cannot be recalled.\n"
"\n"
"OPTIONS:\n"
"  -K, --keyservers SERVERS    Send to these, space separated\n"
"                              Empty for none. Default: %s\n"
"  -h, --help                  Print this help and exit\n"
"  -V, --version               Print the version and exit\n"
msgstr ""
"Usage: %s push [OPTIONS]... EMPREINTE...\n"
"\n"
"Envoyer des certificats aux serveurs de clés tels quels, sans rien\n"
"changer. Empreintes seulement : ce qui est publié ne se rappelle pas.\n"
"\n"
"OPTIONS:\n"
"  -K, --keyservers SERVEURS   Envoyer à ceux-ci, séparés par des espaces\n"
"                              Vide pour aucun. Défaut : %s\n"
"  -h, --help                  Afficher cette aide et quitter\n"
"  -V, --version               Afficher la version et quitter\n"

